      "content": "The major consists of 48 units. All majors are strongly encouraged to pursue a minor and complete as many internships as possible. Pursuant to current University policy, no one majoring in Public Relations may also double-major or minor in a program offered by the Department of Journalism &amp; Public Relations. Consult the CSULB Catalog for additional details.",
      "contentHtml": "<p>The major consists of 48 units.</p><p><br></p><p>All majors are strongly encouraged to pursue a minor and complete as many internships as possible.</p><p><br></p><p>Pursuant to current University policy, no one majoring in Public Relations may also double-major or minor in a program offered by the Department of Journalism &amp; Public Relations.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Consult</strong> the <a href=\"https://csulb.catalog.acalog.com/preview_program.php?catoid=12&amp;poid=6435\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">CSULB Catalog</a> for additional details.</p>"
